# Your keys. The app copies this to .env in your profile folder (~/JobOyster/.env) the first time it runs;
# fill that one in. It never goes in git.
# JobsPipe API key (dashboard at jobspipe.dev; starts with jp_live_)
JOBSPIPE_API_KEY=
# Only for `models.backend: api`. The default backend (claude-code) uses your Claude
# subscription through the `claude` CLI and must NOT have an API key here.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# Notion internal integration token; share the Tasks database with the integration
NOTION_TOKEN=
# Optional, for the Startups tab's "Look up the round" (a startup the news feeds didn't cover). Any one works;
# they're tried in this order. Fundable (tryfundable.ai): 200 free lookups, then $20/month. TheirStack
# (theirstack.com): 50 free company lookups a month. People Data Labs (peopledatalabs.com): 100 free a month.
FUNDABLE_API_KEY=
THEIRSTACK_API_KEY=
PDL_API_KEY=
# Optional: a Chromium build other than Playwright's own
# PLAYWRIGHT_CHROMIUM_EXECUTABLE=/opt/pw-browsers/chromium
